    <string name="ui_potential_review_counts_only_currently_removable_candid" formatted="false">Potential review counts only currently removable candidates and is not a promise of immediately free disk space. When Android can prove a SAF URI maps to the same MediaStore item, ApexTuner normalizes that alias in byte totals; unknown providers remain isolated for safety. Media moved to Trash continues using storage until permanently removed.</string>
