    <string name="ui_the_estimate_is_advisory_because_codec_efficiency_varie" formatted="false">The estimate is advisory because codec efficiency varies by content and device. ApexTuner commits only if the staged result is actually smaller than the original.</string>
    <string name="ui_the_photo_picker_provides_a_privacy_preserving_read_onl" formatted="false">The Photo Picker provides a privacy-preserving read-only fallback for selected photos/videos. Downloads and social-media cleanup use only folders or files you explicitly grant through Android\'s document picker. Android 11+ may block restricted roots such as Downloads root and Android/data; ApexTuner does not bypass those protections.</string>
    <string name="ui_the_scan_stopped_at_the_bounded_item_limit_to_protect_m" formatted="false">The scan stopped at the bounded item limit to protect memory and responsiveness. Narrow folder access and scan again for a complete pass.</string>
    <string name="ui_this_android_source_combination_supports_only_permanent" formatted="false">This Android/source combination supports only permanent deletion for the selected items.</string>
    <string name="ui_this_is_distinct_from_save_as_copy_apextuner_will_first" formatted="false">This is distinct from Save as copy. ApexTuner will first create the complete compressed result and a rollback snapshot, then overwrite only this original after Android grants any required write access.</string>
